                                        "entry_id": "837ee25a-7da4-3c61-bc1b-0f07d2d56d7f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a disjointed manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5b52ee1-55dc-483c-8430-3646be1a4789",
                                                "sense_id": "aa2826f3-12c4-3da9-b38f-9d5a634491f1",
                                                "text": "On the thirteenth day I drank some more water, and dozed and thought disjointedly of eating and of vague impossible plans of escape."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
